  ['E','Production','On Set, In-House Crew','Who\'s executing, and how?','Precision execution on set with an in-house crew, no outsourced gaps.',['Directing','Cinematography','Sound Recording','Production Management','Multi-Format Capture']],
  ['K','Post-Production','Edit, Color, Sound','How does raw footage become a piece?','Edit, color, and sound, the craft that turns footage into a finished piece.',['Offline & Online Edit','Color Grading','Sound Design & Mix','Multi-Format Delivery']],
